description:
`white-space: pre` was appended to the top-level CSS block, applied via `.svglite text`:

```
  <style type='text/css'><![CDATA[
    .svglite line, .svglite polyline, .svglite polygon, .svglite path, .svglite rect, .svglite circle {
      fill: none;
      stroke: #000000;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
      stroke-miterlimit: 10.00;
    }
    .svglite text {
      white-space: pre;
    }
  ]]></style>
```

and a test for the presence of this rule was added and all the test SVGs have this rule.

`NEWS.md` modified to note this change.

Visual validation:

```
library(svglite)
library(ggplot2)

x <- svgstring()
print(
  ggplot() +
    geom_text(
      aes(x=1, y=2, label = "no leading spaces\n   has leading spaces"),
      hjust = 0, lineheight = 0.875
    ) +
    theme_void()
)
dev.off()

x()
```

